      "source_contract": "For a normal subgroup N of G, mu(G) <= mu(G/N)+mu_prime(N). If N is abelian, mu(G) <= mu(G/N)+mu_prime_G(N), with G acting on N by conjugation. The printed source says a group; this contract takes finite G.",
