      "source_id": "N003",
      "source_reference": "Theorem 2.1",
      "source_contract": "For n >= 7, every independent generating set S of S_n of size n-1 is S(T), the edge transpositions of a labelled tree T, or {s} union {(s t)^epsilon(t): t in S(T) except s}, where s in S(T) and epsilon(t) in {+1,-1}. Conversely every set of either form is an independent generating set of S_n.",
